          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Walter Ihring is a Slovak illustrator and author who has spent more than three decades drawing the world with wit, precision, and an eye for the quietly extraordinary.</strong> His linework carries a gentle irony; his humour is subtle yet sharp, attuned to fleeting moments most people overlook. He first gained recognition in the Slovak cartoon scene by blending observational humour with elegantly restrained line art.</p>"
